From 04f71e36a191bdd26be2c2c2e0c9aaed89956e4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quinn <coderquinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:53:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(access): let a second site select the active Test Profile

When the Test Profile is active and its listener is acknowledged, an explicit selection for another site reuses the current registration: only the site policy is committed and acknowledged. No re-registration, revocation or re-import happens, and a failed reuse never interrupts the sites already using the listener. The toolbar entry uses CanSelectTestProfileForSite and returns once the site is unprotected.
